          "guid": "mt532qpgirxihfhw",
          "message": {
            "text": "URL mask patterns must keep Blink’s positioning and painting rectangles independent. BackgroundImageGeometry derives round/space tile size and phase from mask-origin, but SVGMaskPainter passes the clip-owned destination to DrawImageTiled; giving buildImagePatternDef only the origin box made an orthogonal no-repeat cell wrap into larger border/padding clips. The final argument preserves that paint destination without changing the shared background geometry model.",
            "markdown": "URL mask patterns must keep Blink’s positioning and painting rectangles independent. `BackgroundImageGeometry` derives round/space tile size and phase from `mask-origin`, but `SVGMaskPainter` passes the clip-owned destination to `DrawImageTiled`; giving `buildImagePatternDef` only the origin box made an orthogonal no-repeat cell wrap into larger border/padding clips. The final argument preserves that paint destination without changing the shared background geometry model."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/mask.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 870,
                  "endLine": 895,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      // Repeating mask: fall back to pattern. Since mask-type=alpha, the\n      // pattern itself needs to be backed by an <image> that's clipped to\n      // the tile size so outside-tile pixels are transparent.\n      const patId = `${id}p${li}`;\n      const patDef = buildImagePatternDef(\n        patId,\n        urlHref,\n        elX,\n        elY,\n        w,\n        h,\n        layerSize,\n        layerPos,\n        layerRepeat,\n        capturedIntrinsic ?? null,\n        \"scroll\",\n        null,\n        null,\n        { x: paintX, y: paintY, width: paintW, height: paintH },\n      );\n      if (patDef === \"\") return { contents, forceHide: false };\n      contents.push(patDef);\n      contents.push(`<rect x=\"${r(paintX)}\" y=\"${r(paintY)}\" width=\"${r(paintW)}\" height=\"${r(paintH)}\" fill=\"url(#${patId})\" />`);\n    }\n  }\n  return { contents, forceHide: false };"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
